  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "物聯網概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO INTERNET OF THINGS",
    "describe_ch": "讓學生了解物聯網的基礎概念與所使用到的各種技術，包含無線網路、感測器、行動裝置等技術，介紹將這些技術整合後在使用在智慧醫療、智慧交通、智慧電網、智慧物流等各項應用中。",
    "describe_eh": "To enable students to know the fundamental concepts and techniques of internet of things (IoT), and the techniques are included wireless network, sensor, and mobile devices. These techniques which are integrated and used in smart healthcare, smart intelligent transport, smart grid, smart logistics, and so forth applications are intruded.",
